d 'XTMVARDLURT_MULTIVARIATE': module to perform panel multivariate ARDL unit root and cointegration test with cross-sectional dependence testing
d
d      For each unit the command estimates the multivariate ARDL
d unit root regression of Sam, McNown, Goh and Goh (2024), D.y = c
d + [trend] + pi L.y + delta'L.x + sum phi_i LiD.y + sum
d Gamma_j'LjD.x + omega'D.x + u,   and computes the t-statistic on
d pi (H0: unit root; lower tail) and the F-statistic on delta (H0:
d no level relationship; upper	  tail; in Case 4 the trend is
d included).  The k covariates are unrestricted in number. The unit
d statistics are combined into	  the panel statistics	     
d t-bar, F-bar: group means of the unit statistics;	   Fisher:
d -2 sum ln(p_i) of the unit bootstrap p-values (Maddala-Wu type); 
d	Inverse-normal: sum Phi^-1(p_i)/sqrt(N) (Choi type).	The
d four-case framework is applied at the panel level (group-mean,
d Fisher and inverse-normal versions) and at the unit level:	I =
d neither rejects (unit root, no cointegration); II = t rejects
d only (stationary); III = F rejects only (degenerate,	  possibly
d I(2)); IV = both reject (cointegration). 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: panel data unit root
d KW: cointegration
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261004
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f xtmvardlurt_multivariate.ado
f xtmvardlurt_multivariate.sthlp
f ../_/_xtmvu_disp.ado
f ../_/_xtmvu_load.ado
f ../_/_xtmvu_mata.ado
f xtmvardlurt_multivariate_example.do
F xtmvardlurt_multivariate_expected.txt
f xtmvardlurt_multivariate_graph.ado
f xtmvardlurt_multivariate_testdata.csv
